  "description": "A Beach Day refers to a recreational visit to a beach, typically during the summer months, by people who do not reside near coastal areas. These visits often involve participation in common beach activities and are frequently undertaken by families or groups of friends.\n\nThe aesthetic of a beach day can vary depending on the region. For example, beaches along the Pacific Coast, such as those in California, exhibit distinct characteristics. This aesthetic differs from that of individuals who live near beaches and frequent them regularly, such as those in tropical regions.",
